Hexane-1,3,6-tricarbonitrile (HTCN) is an acyclic nitrile compound with three nitrile groups and no other functional groups. Nitrile-function compounds fall in HTSUS 2926. Heading 2926.90 covers other nitrile-function compounds. The subheading is 2926.90.50 for "Other", with the statistical suffix to be confirmed.

I recall that the antidumping investigation on hexanetricarbonitrile from China and India lists HTS 2926.90.5050 as the principal classification. The scope language says it is "currently classified under HTSUS subheading 2926.90.5050." I am relying on that recollection.

